PowOS web: the number of times a TB runs in the interpreter (TCI) before it is compiled to Wasm comes from
tcg/wasm32-config.h, written by targets/web/build-qemu.sh (QEMU_WASM_INSTANTIATE_NUM, default 1500 as upstream).
A huge value keeps everything in TCI: tells Wasm-backend bugs from others.

--- a/tcg/wasm32.h
+++ b/tcg/wasm32.h
@@ -37,6 +37,9 @@

 void init_wasm32();

+#include "wasm32-config.h"
+#ifndef INSTANTIATE_NUM
 #define INSTANTIATE_NUM 1500
+#endif

 #endif
